# Exclude dev-only artifacts from Docker build context
# NOTE: tests/ is NOT excluded — the test Dockerfile needs it.
# Packaging Dockerfiles (pkg/docker/) build from the tarball, so
# tests/ in their context is harmless extra bytes.
.git/
docs/
audit-output/
.rdf/
.claude/
.github/
pkg/build/
CLAUDE.md
PLAN*.md
AUDIT.md
MEMORY.md
REGR.md
PRESSURE.md
